## Claim under pressure

SPRINT **CAP-G3** (grant matrix / unused V2 grants honesty):
- `main(p: &HttpCap)` injects `oo_cap_grant_http`, not `grant_net`.
- `main(fs: &FsReadCap)` injects `oo_cap_grant_fsread`, not `grant_fs`.
- `main(fs: &FsWriteCap)` injects `oo_cap_grant_fswrite`.
- Pure / undeclared caps must not mint full privilege bag as live tokens.
- HW/UI/Process: wire product require path or honest residual-only.
- Dual path: `oodac check` refuse + runtime wrong-token refuse remain CAP-G1/G2 path-A.

Adversarial stance: treat any emit path where declared type is granular but runtime
token is legacy supersede as CRIT privilege widen when check is skippable.

